        <detaileddescription>
<para>Same, but picks the models out of a ListModels result by name - the usual shape, since you know your TTS/STT/language model names. Names that are not present are ignored, so a model the player has not downloaded yet does not silently empty the menu. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
