        <definition>static bool UTryllLanguages::HasLanguageInfo</definition>
        <argsstring>(const TArray&lt; FTryllModelInfo &gt; &amp;Models)</argsstring>
        <name>HasLanguageInfo</name>
        <qualifiedname>UTryllLanguages::HasLanguageInfo</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const TArray&lt; <ref refid="struct_f_tryll_model_info" kindref="compound">FTryllModelInfo</ref> &gt; &amp;</type>
          <declname>Models</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>True when at least one model declared its languages. Distinguishes &quot;these
models share no language&quot; from &quot;we have no idea&quot;, which are very different things to show a player. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
